Z||000009||2xsess||12-29-2000||11:35 PM||||Her name was Tina. <P>Welcome to the forum Lisa.    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>This is the body style of the 85Gts and the 86-87SEs<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/tonstv02.gif">  <BR>This is the 86-88GT..we refer to them as Fastbacks<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/lfront.jpg">  <BR>This is the 87-88 coupe and also the formula<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Mybaby.jpg">  <BR>Most of the formulas had the spoiler on them<BR>And this is the 84 Indy model<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/indyrule.jpg"> <P>That should help clear up some of your confusion<P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>AOL IM : Only2xsess<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/My_car_(large)sig_1.JPG">   <P>[This message has been edited by 2xsess (edited 12-29-2000).]<p>[This message has been edited by 2xsess (edited 12-29-2000).]||||reg||1
